ext-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">The top models by Intelligence Index are: 1. Claude Fable 5.1 (Adaptive Reasoning, Max Effort, Default Fallback) (57), 2. GPT-6 Astra (max) (55), 3. GPT-6 Astra (xhigh) (54), 4. Claude Opus 5 (Adaptive Reasoning, Max Effort) (54), 5. Claude Opus 5 (Adaptive Reasoning, Xhigh Effort) (53).</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_16r5fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_6r5fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">Which AI model has the fastest output speed?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_16r5fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_6r5fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">Celeris-1 is the fastest at 1,552.5 tokens per second, followed by Mercury 2 (807.2 t/s) and Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite (Reasoning) (410.4 t/s).</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_18r5fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_8r5fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">Which AI model is the most affordable?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_18r5fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_8r5fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">Granite 4.2 3B has the lowest cost per Intelligence Index task at $0.01, followed by Granite 4.2 8B ($0.02) and Ling 3.0 Flash ($0.03).</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_1ar5fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_ar5fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">Which is the best open weights model on the leaderboard?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1ar5fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_ar5fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">Kimi K3 (max) is the highest-ranked open weights model with an Intelligence Index score of 50. There are 18 open weights models out of 55 total on the leaderboard.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_1cr5fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_cr5fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">What are the top open weights models on the leaderboard?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1cr5fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_cr5fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">The top open weights models by Intelligence Index are: 1. Kimi K3 (max) (50), 2. GLM-5.3 (max) (49), 3. Qwen3.8 2.4T A95B (47).</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_1er5fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_er5fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">Which is the best reasoning model on the leaderboard?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform 